const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'How Much Does It Cost to Build a Business Website in Delhi NCR?',
    a: 'Website development costs in Delhi NCR generally depend on your project scope and platform. A single-page marketing landing page typically ranges between ₹8,000 and ₹20,000. A standard 6 to 10 page corporate business website ranges between ₹25,000 and ₹55,000. Custom dynamic web applications or full e-commerce stores with payment gateways range from ₹50,000 to ₹1,50,000+. NK Digital Tech provides clear, fixed-price proposals with no hidden monthly fees.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How Do You Ensure Our New Website Gets Cited in ChatGPT, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews?',
    a: 'Generative AI models and Google AI Overviews rely on factual, structured information to answer user prompts. We design your website with clear, direct answer paragraphs, structured HTML tables, validated JSON-LD schema (Organization, Service, and LocalBusiness), open robot access for AI crawlers like GPTBot and PerplexityBot, and verified business facts that AI engines can easily read and cite.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Why Is Fast Mobile Speed Critical for Business Websites in Delhi NCR?',
    a: 'More than 70% of business inquiries and customer visits in Delhi, Gurgaon, and Noida originate from smartphones on mobile data networks. If your website takes longer than three seconds to load, over half of those visitors will leave immediately for a competitor. Google also uses mobile page speed as a primary ranking signal in its search algorithm.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What Is the Difference Between a Custom Coded Website and a WordPress Template?',
    a: 'A pre-made WordPress template often comes bloated with dozens of unneeded scripts, third-party plugins, and messy database calls that slow down your pages and create security risks. A custom coded website, built on modern static frameworks like Astro or React, loads in under one second, requires zero routine plugin updates, and cannot be hacked through common WordPress vulnerabilities.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How Long Does It Take to Design, Develop, and Launch a Website?',
    a: 'A standard corporate website of 5 to 10 pages is typically delivered in two to three weeks from wireframe approval to final launch. More complex e-commerce stores or custom B2B web portals with product databases generally take three to five weeks. We share a clear milestone schedule before work begins and keep you updated weekly.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do You Give Us Full Ownership of the Website Code, Domain, and Hosting?',
    a: 'Yes, 100%. Unlike agencies that lock client websites into proprietary servers or retain administrative passwords, NK Digital Tech hands over complete administrative access to your domain, code repository, hosting server, and analytics accounts upon final project delivery. You own every digital asset completely.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can You Redesign an Old Website Without Losing Existing Google Rankings?',
    a: 'Yes. When we rebuild an existing website, our team performs a complete URL audit to ensure every established page is either matched exactly or mapped through clean 301 redirects. We retain your existing meta tags, schema structure, and high-ranking content so your search visibility remains protected throughout the launch.',
